<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: CZECH CBANK ONE-WEEK REV REPO AVE YIELD 18.2 PCT.</title>
<headline>CZECH CBANK ONE-WEEK REV REPO AVE YIELD 18.2 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Average yield in the Czech National Bank's (CNB) one-week reverse repo tender to drain market liquidity was 18.2 percent.</p>
<p>The CNB added in a statement that all bids at the maximum rate of 18.2 percent were satisfied.</p>
<p>The CNB has been performing open market operations almost daily in order to regulate liquidity on the market since currency crisis and interest rate hikes in late May.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
